title: "Attack Traffic Classifier"
abstract: "Offline, reproducible Python research pipeline that audits original and corrected CICIDS2017 network-flow datasets, trains chronological-split random-forest intrusion-detection baselines with validation-frozen thresholds, and reports results together with their limitations."
